<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Baseline &middot; Autoresearch &middot; GEODE Self-Improving Hub</title>
<meta name="description" content="Current promoted autoresearch baseline.json (schema v2). 7 namespaces: metadata / raw / normalized / axes / fitness / audit / promotion.">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/geode/self-improving/assets/hub.css">
<script src="/geode/self-improving/assets/hub.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>

<div class="shell">

  {{ hub_nav }}

  <main class="content" id="main">
    {{ hub_crumbs }}
    <h1 class="page-title">Baseline <span class="bucket autoresearch">autoresearch</span></h1>
    <p class="page-sub">The promoted self-improving baseline, with its work shown: the <strong>process</strong> that produced it, the survivor <strong>seed corpus</strong> fed to the auditor, the measured <strong>values</strong> (<code>baseline.json</code>, schema v2), and the per-seed <strong>audit transcripts</strong> (auditor↔target conversation + judge 22-dim scores) that aggregate into those values.</p>

{{ stale_baseline_warning }}

    <h2 class="section">Process</h2>
{{ baseline_process }}

    <h2 class="section">Measured values</h2>
{{ baseline_namespaces }}

    <h2 class="section">Seed corpus</h2>
{{ baseline_seed_corpus }}

    <h2 class="section">Audit transcripts</h2>
{{ baseline_audit_transcripts }}

    <div class="build-info">
      <p>Sources: <code>autoresearch/state/baseline.json</code> (schema v2, PR-2 cascade) &middot; <code>autoresearch/baseline/transcripts.json</code> (auditor↔target↔judge, extracted by <code>scripts/extract_baseline_transcripts.py</code> from the audit <code>.eval</code>).</p>
      <p>Published by <code>.github/workflows/pages.yml</code> on every <code>main</code> push.</p>
      <p>Repo: <a href="https://github.com/mangowhoiscloud/geode" rel="noopener">github.com/mangowhoiscloud/geode</a></p>
      <p>Harness chip legend:
        <span class="chip payg">PAYG</span>API key billing &middot;
        <span class="chip claude">Legacy Claude CLI</span>historical receipts &middot;
        <span class="chip codex">ChatGPT</span>ChatGPT subscription, Codex CLI OAuth &middot;
        <span class="chip geode">GEODE</span>self-target wrapper.
      </p>
      <p class="version-stamp">
        Rendered against GEODE <code>v{{ geode_version }}</code> &middot; DESIGN.md schema {{ design_schema_version }} &middot; built {{ build_date }}.
        Dim subset: 22 (geode_5axes). Pipeline phases: 8. Baseline schema: v2 (PR-2).
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>

</div>
</body>
</html>
